  <title>Inventory history</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Products</gui><gui>Inventory
  history</gui></guiseq> lists each time a stocked product came in or went
  out: received, sold, made, used in manufacturing, counted, adjusted or
  transferred, with the date, quantity and location.</p>

  <p>Choose the product, and the location in the box beside it. Check
  <gui>View all</gui> to see the movements of every product at that
  location.</p>

</page>
